    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Store a map of <ref refid="namespaceIMP_1_1domino_1a3419fc2c9def4e8cfe47550df045e24c" kindref="member">Assignments</ref> objects and return them on demand. This table should be used when each subset is sampled using some other protocol (eg Monte Carlo or molecular dynamics) and those states are then fed in to domino. </para>
